      "publicNotes": "<p>The M-44 Hammerhead is a fast hover-tank designed for speed over durability. It glides above terrain at high velocity and fires guided missiles at high-value targets. Its hover capability allows it to traverse water, lava flows, and other impassable terrain. More fragile than the Mako, it relies on speed and agility for survival.</p>",
